WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.160
- [Narrator] These are pączki.

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:05.000
Or if it's on its own, it's a pączek.

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:08.300
It's a Polish treat made
from deep-frying dough

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.163
with a stuffed sugary jam filling.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:14.200
And then it's covered in
even more sugary icing.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.157
Basically, it's the
definition of delicious.

00:00:17.157 --> 00:00:19.020
- Num.
- Oy.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:19.910
Don't touch.

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.363
We need to film it first.

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:28.430
Warsaw's a vibrant city
with a bit of a sweet tooth,

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:31.340
and that's where pączki comes in.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.530
There are a few spots around
the city to get pączki

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:36.400
but no more authentic than here.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.893
This tiny bakery has been
producing pączki since 1925.

00:00:46.984 --> 00:00:48.300
- [Narrator] Sylwia's great-grandfather

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.150
created the secret family recipe,

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.443
which still stays strong to this day.

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:41.470
- [Narrator] And on Fat Thursday,

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:43.330
the last Thursday before Lent,

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:44.923
boy do they sell a few more.

00:01:50.083 --> 00:01:50.916
- [Narrator] 8,000 to 10,000?

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:22.620
- [Narrator] Nor can we, Sylwia.

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:23.536
Nor can we.

00:02:23.536 --> 00:02:27.203
(gentle instrumental music)

